{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>```json\n{\n  \"sec\": \"\",\n  \"mech\": \"\",\n  \"why\": \"没有。S01-M12、S04-M12、S05-M15等看似能补上这一前提的候选，都已将过去与具体的人亲近或如今无法相伴写进自身前提，属于预设而非独立建立；S05-M20、M36等候选也未能独立证明同一个具体的人既曾与他真实亲近、如今又不在身边。其余候选至多支持怀念、想与某人分享快乐或对方心意不明，不能补足这段真实相伴及当下缺席的历史。\"\n}\n```</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "cf50df2f-3343-4e44-959b-b9439a492430", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261027T231501762317Z", "elapsed_seconds": 135.641, "completed_utc": "2026-10-27T23:17:17.406870+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1e6f8b9e2f7f1520b8f33e3d9f2f9734c82017ca4cfee0c3a42238339b353869", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "